## Conventions

- Minimize diff scope; match existing code style
- Gate features in API (security) AND UI (visibility)
- Use `z.string()` for upload URLs (relative `/uploads/...` paths in dev)
- Do not commit `.env`, `generated/`, `.next/`
- Only git commit when user explicitly asks
